      <span class="a2a_kit a2a_kit_size_32 addtoany_list" data-a2a-url="https://www.sema.org/news-media/press-release/new-sema-research-2025-market-report" data-a2a-title="NEW SEMA RESEARCH: 2025 MARKET REPORT"><a class="a2a_button_facebook"></a><a class="a2a_button_twitter"></a><a class="a2a_button_linkedin"></a><a class="a2a_button_email"></a></span>
  
